<title>USA: Acme United Corp Q4 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Acme United Corp Q4 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFIELD, Conn. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>FOURTH QUARTER REPORT 1996</p>
<p>			     Qtr Ended		Qtr Ended</p>
<p>			  Dec 31, 1996	   Dec 31, 1995</p>
<p>   Net Sales	    $9,378,000	    $11,017,000</p>
<p> Net (Loss)/Income     (634,000)	    (8,724,000)</p>
<p>(Loss)/Earnings</p>
<p> Per Share		     (.19)		   (2.61)</p>
<p>			    Year Ended	     Year Ended</p>
<p>			  Dec 31, 1996	   Dec 31, 1995</p>
<p> Net Sales		47,481,000	     52,222,000</p>
<p> Net (Loss)/Income   (3,175,000)	    (8,716,000)</p>
<p>(Loss)/Earnings</p>
<p>  Per Share		    (.95)		   (2.61)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net loss for the fourth quarter and fiscal year 1995 included an inventory valuation and restructuring charge of $6,518,000.</p>
